# macro n i, as a player whose 'chests opened' grew, at the chest: does he look at the cursed chest n? (a ray from the eyes, 6 blocks)
$execute at @s anchored eyes positioned ^ ^ ^0.5 if entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=le.cc,scores={le.tid=$(n)},distance=..0.95] run return run function last_ember:trap/gen/open_$(i)
